{"v":4,"catch":"Parasomnia Verum 是一款關於反覆出現的夢境的恐怖遊戲。","desc":"你扮演 Maddy，他總是做噩夢。 她試圖通過會見專門研究夢境及其研究的威爾伯教授來解決這個問題，但在她的夢中他們發現了一些險惡的東西。 經過幾次實驗後，很難分辨什麼是真實的，什麼只是夢，以及那個夢是否屬於你。\n\n該遊戲是一種氛圍體驗，通過探索、庫存功能以及 Maddy 和 Wilbur 教授的研究的險惡背景故事提供故事。","publisher":"Vidas Games","release":"2021-10-28","genres":["其他","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9864edc0ba39f71731c8e7e302cfcb1ddd0a30c4107aad399749f25903de6cf2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/411ed44e36b354b9afd7beb568140300afc3b1f12cacb857c4587c81e05db12c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3998557906ecb2c543158d96dfa2d2e1e60810af1f1f32580b9cfc283c3a2113.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/63404dce4effa70fb81dd68c47bf4364c7417184bc7785dfccd7624a304dc5f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/193d16c4c217d60531b276ac2a153e55f5d7a63ca1cae363a07e14bf5fe3c1ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/17dbf7ba803d00f57bc10edd8352fb7799e9b6fc4b25580b01e2dfb737c2c5cd.jpg"],"titleId":"010055a015ce6000","dlc":[]}